      {
        "author_name": "Gary Machado",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105547796614339530689/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJWDp3MY_RJR520emno9rE8LdSLNEIEhD245gjj0foMhUcKun2hQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I've been here twice in a month, first with direct family and then with 10 people. Both times we had the same waitress Caroline. Super nice, friendly, professional and always smiling. The food is great, prices have remained stable and the portion size is large.",
        "time": 1760393014,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dale Samuels",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113467940273113460124/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXt_rTy8GoZnMzwqvtiA3gCAxC37-MGNyCIAc58dJWAEfx8dcS4Fg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Very good place to catch a quick breakfast or lunch. Staff is very kind and patient. The food is very reasonably priced, freshly made and tasty.  Highly recommend",
        "time": 1753721344,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kanth Kanthan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112124225778940997200/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLxfdsAKyuH7wWR-vSVOBuNVB6p3KWexlX_qdbWmYhf1UDxlg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Nice spot for lunch and breakfast. I got free soup for lunch... I am in Vaudreuil-Dorion more then 2 years.. we never receive tutti fruit flyers.. please we need flyers card..thank you",
        "time": 1764961057,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "giulia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115497058112742538976/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAdRstWRjjF0Ywtcpr0w8kZl_Pbhpf_M2U1AnK4CilZLrGHw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We went on a Monday afternoon. Our waitress was really nice and friendly! But our food was terrible. I ordered a bacon and sausage bowl which was okay (I would never order it again). We also got a grilled cheese Benedict which was terrible. It was cold when we first got it, and the cheese wasn’t even melted. Overall not a good dish. But the service was good!",
        "time": 1764622448,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tim",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113149969439514849784/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKz74BMaggPllTWgBAqergFH55K3VNDxb3HDQAywObTK9P4AA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very large selection of many different breakfasts and styles.  Great for a group of people that want some things different.   The food was good and warm.  Generous portions.  The maple syrup was not real maple, and was a little off putting, but edible (consider Quebec makes around 40 percent of the world’s maple syrup it was a big let down).   The place over all was enjoyable, a solid 4.",
        "time": 1695520749,
        "translated": false
      }
